WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.425
<v Safi>How can animals live here?

00:00:04.775 --> 00:00:11.424
<v Nuri>Let’s watch two things: a camel’s feet as it walks, and a fox in the midday heat.

00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:15.403
<v Hadi>Oh! My wheel sank into the sand.

00:00:15.753 --> 00:00:19.762
<v Hadi>The camel walked right across. What’s special about its feet?

00:00:21.262 --> 00:00:30.631
<v Nuri>Two objects weigh the same. One has a narrow base, the other a wide base. Which will sink deeper?

00:00:33.331 --> 00:00:38.940
<v Hadi>The narrow base sank deeper. I saw its stripe disappear into the sand.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:45.779
<v Nuri>Yes. The wide base spreads the same weight over more sand, so it presses less at each spot.

00:00:47.429 --> 00:00:53.278
<v Hadi>Look as the camel puts its weight down. Its soft foot spreads out, helping it walk on sand.

00:00:54.828 --> 00:00:58.757
<v Nuri>Here is a real camel. See if you can find its hump.

00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:05.205
<v Safi>The camel is drinking. What does it store in its hump?

00:01:05.555 --> 00:01:12.284
<v Nuri>Its hump stores fat. When food is scarce, its body uses that fat for energy.

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:21.003
<v Nuri>Allah says in the Quran: Do they not look at the camels, how they are created?

00:01:22.653 --> 00:01:24.739
<v Safi>Teacher Nuri, I see ears sticking out!

00:01:25.089 --> 00:01:33.178
<v Nuri>It’s a fennec fox. Its large ears help release heat. In the midday sun it has another way to stay cool.

00:01:33.528 --> 00:01:37.537
<v Hadi>It went back into its burrow. It can shelter from the sun there.

00:01:39.037 --> 00:01:45.606
<v Nuri>Here is a real fennec fox. By day it often rests in a burrow cooler than the sunlit sand.

00:01:48.106 --> 00:01:51.867
<v Safi>If we come back as the sun goes down, what might change?

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:58.236
<v Nuri>As the air cools, the fox begins to come out to look for food.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:07.995
<v Hadi>I found two answers. Broad feet support the camel on sand. The fox avoids the hot sun by choosing when to leave its burrow.

00:02:08.345 --> 00:02:13.154
<v Nuri>Well observed. Let’s thank Allah for creating these animals.
